Thank you for this constructive suggestion. Yes, as we wrote this paper, we already had the idea of kernel capacity implicitly, as we also computed the intrinsic dimension and the stable rank of the kernel matrix, which is closely related to its effective dimension:

\begin{eqnarray}
    \text{ED} = \sum_{j} \frac{\lambda_j}{\lambda_j+\lambda}.
\end{eqnarray}

We promise to extend the discussion of spectral richness to kernel capacity together with regularization.
